{"id":"96f7716d43f7dd6a","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-desc-complexity.md","title":"固定语言的最短句长（局部度量）","display":"df-desc-complexity — 固定语言的最短句长（局部度量）","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-desc-complexity","aliases":["29-df-desc-complexity"],"display":"df-desc-complexity — 固定语言的最短句长（局部度量）","depends_on":["[[29-df-sentence]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]","[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-vocab]]"],"source_locator":"§11.4 historical discussion, pp.179–180, DjVu scans194–195; local definition of fixed-language minimum sentence length","source_basis":"原书区分描述复杂性与最短程序长度；dc为本库局部度量，非原书核心定义"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-desc-complexity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-desc-complexity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-desc-complexity — 固定语言的最短句长（局部度量）"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§11.4 historical discussion, pp.179–180, DjVu scans194–195; local definition of fixed-language minimum sentence length"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"原书区分描述复杂性与最短程序长度；dc为本库局部度量，非原书核心定义"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"28e86a5f0243a0ae\" href=\"?note=28e86a5f0243a0ae\" title=\"29-df-vocab\">29-df-vocab</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> has sentence set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau]\\)</span> and satisfaction relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\varphi|_{\\mathcal L}\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(|\\varphi|_{\\mathcal L}\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 是预先固定的公式编码长度；每个句子长度有限，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span> 为大于任意自然数的额外值。此条定义固定语言内的最短句长，不将其等同于描述复杂性研究领域。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\}\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau]\n\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\}\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau]\n\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}desc\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{dc}_{\\mathcal L}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\left\\{\n|\\varphi|_{\\mathcal L}\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau]\\land\nS=\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\}\n\\right\\},\n&amp;S\\in\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau],\\\\\n\\infty,\n&amp;S\\notin\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau].\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}desc\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{dc}_{\\mathcal L}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\left\\{\n|\\varphi|_{\\mathcal L}\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau]\\land\nS=\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\}\n\\right\\},\n&amp;S\\in\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau],\\\\\n\\infty,\n&amp;S\\notin\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau].\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是本库保留的局部描述长度度量。原书pp179–180（扫描194–195）区分早期按输入大小变化的FO-SIZE、以语言表达能力研究查询的描述复杂性，以及固定通用程序的Kolmogorov复杂度。不能把本条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dc}\">\\(\\operatorname{dc}\\)</span>的最短句长公式冒充Immerman对整个领域的定义。对可定义查询，候选长度是非空自然数集，所以最小值存在；对不可定义查询，单独返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span>。选择公式编码会影响数值，必须把该编码作为参数约定保留。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"28e86a5f0243a0ae","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}$ and $S\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]$ (see [[29-df-vocab]] and [[29-df-struc]])","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}$ and $S\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]$ (see [[29-df-vocab]] and [[29-df-struc]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{Vocabulary}","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"|\\varphi|_{\\mathcal L}\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau]\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\}\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau]\n\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}desc\\text{-}complexity}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{dc}_{\\mathcal L}(S)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\min\\left\\{\n|\\varphi|_{\\mathcal L}\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau]\\land\nS=\\{A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\mid A\\models_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\}\n\\right\\},\n&S\\in\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau],\\\\\n\\infty,\n&S\\notin\\operatorname{Def}_{\\mathcal L}[\\tau].\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dc}","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty","display":false}],"bytes":2359,"backlinks":[{"id":"4736ea955594a4a8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-177","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-desc-complexity]] — 固定语言最短句长的局部度量；区分原书领域概念"},{"id":"805a7de3b1249a36","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-desc-complexity]]"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-desc-complexity]]"},{"id":"08f453008a616925","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-desc-complexity|29-df-desc-complexity]]"}],"outgoing":["711217f22972ffc0","3ee556c64b16809b","4de8e0c8085801f5","28e86a5f0243a0ae"]}